yback  and he just so happened to conveniently  fit the bill for her third required  sacrifice  the holy man in fact lola's plans may  have gone down in an  entirely different way had the warrens  never intervened in the first place  one can assume that david glatzel was  originally intended to be the child of  purity sacrifice  followed by arnie the lover but when  arnie pleaded for the demon to take him  lola had to improvise and sought out a  fresh new virgin victim with jessica  strong  it's also quite possible that father  gordon or even her own estranged father  father krasner could have easily been  the originally intended holy man  but when those meddling warrens spoiled  her plans she chose to inflict the curse  on ed  either way lola had options and she's  clearly the puppet master controlling  the demon's every move  and she can strike any cursed individual  at any time  as long as she's at her infernal altar  that is  moments before his slasher-style murder  at the hands of lola  father krasner reveals that the altar is  the source of lola's power  destroying it will break the curse and  vanquish the demon's grasp over ed  and arnie armed with a sledgehammer ed  narrowly pulls this off as lola makes  one last attempt to use her diabolical  mind tricks to fool him  into eliminating his own wife but the  love and bond between the warrens proves  to be too strong  as lorraine puts it she thinks our love  is a weakness but it's not  it's our strength ed breaks free from  the demon's grasp and strikes down the  altar instead of his wife  naturally the demon isn't too pleased  with lola either  seeing as how she failed at her task of  delivering the final two cursed  souls so instead the demon decides her  soul will have to do  the demon mangles her body on the spot  ding dong the witch is dead  once again it's a happy ending for the  warrens we see ed placed the goblet that  lola used to summon  and control her demon placed on a shelf  near the annabelle doll  in the warrens's ever-growing collection  of supernatural artifacts  as the movie closes we get a final shot  of them with a freshly built gazebo in  their backyard  which is a callback to an earlier story  that lorraine tells father gordon  while they're in the hospital after ed's  heart attack 30 years ago  ed and lorraine first met in a movie  theater when she was 17 years old they  went out for ice cream and it started to  rain  so ed took her to a nearby gazebo where  they shared their first kiss  it was the moment that marked the  beginning of their undying love  the relationship between this unique  driven husband and wife couple  is without a doubt the emotional center  of the conjuring the devil made me do it  as well as the beating heart of the  conjuring series of movies in general  as for arnie johnson well there were a  bulk of creative liberties taken  regarding his supernatural exploits  behind bars  his real-life story after the events  that inspired the conjuring the devil  made me do it reportedly proceeded in  much the same way as the movie implied  arnie was ultimately charged with first  degree manslaughter and was slammed with  a 10 to 20 year prison sentence but he  was released from prison  after only serving five he married his  wife while he was in prison  and they are still married to this day  while the ending to their love story  might not be as bright and cheery as the  warrens is  it's clear that even after being faced  with such a traumatic ordeal  their love too ultimately endured check  out one of our newest videos right here  plus even more looper videos about the  conjuring universe are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one

